Description: Add the os/net header dir to SYSTEM_INCLUDE_PATHS
 The netservices private headers pulled in by this app
 (private/netservices/UrlContext.h) include <Certificate.h>, which lives
 in /system/develop/headers/os/net — a directory the packaged vos.specs
 (data/develop/vos.specs on vos master) does not put on the include path,
 unlike every other kit dir. Without it the build stops at:
   /system/develop/headers/private/netservices/UrlContext.h:11:10:
   fatal error: Certificate.h: No such file or directory
Author: Numerio <b.vitruvio@gmail.com>
Forwarded: not-needed
Origin: V\OS port of HaikuArchives/Weather

--- a/Makefile
+++ b/Makefile
@@ -75,7 +75,8 @@
 #	NOT auto-included here.
 SYSTEM_INCLUDE_PATHS = /system/develop/headers/private/shared \
 					   /system/develop/headers/private/interface \
-					   /system/develop/headers/private/netservices
+					   /system/develop/headers/private/netservices \
+					   /system/develop/headers/os/net
 
 #	Additional paths paths to look for local headers. These use the form
 #	#include "header". Directories that contain the files in SRCS are
